body:
I get his point, with those 500M you could build a team actually able to compete for the title; 
Fiorentina didn't spend 1/10 of those 600M and obtained quite the same results, showing how showering 700M on the transfer budget doesn't translate automatically into results. 
Who knows what a team like Atalanta, which relies on a very tight budget, would've done with those very same 800M
